extends layout
block content
  .ui.container.rules-container
    .ui.text.container
      h1.ui.header.centered Gameplay Rules
    .ui.text.container
      p.understated During the games played as part of the competition, you must comply with the following rules.
      h2.ui.header.centered RULES
      ul.ui.list
        li
          strong Be respectful when communicating in chat.
          p We do not tolerate hatespeech, personal insults, or other offensive language on the competition platform.
        li
          strong Only communicate with other players through the official game chat window during a game.
          p To ensure that the AI players have the same information as the human participants, we forbid any communication between the players outside of the official game chat (i.e., via Discord) while playing a game.
        li
          strong Keep your user identity anonymous.
          p During the games, your usernames will be anonymized. Do not actively try to deanonymize yourself or other players. To refer to other players in the game, use their seat number.
        li
          strong One account per player.
          p Each person may participate in the contest only with exactly one account.
        li
          strong No intentional game throwing.
          p Each contest participant is expected to give their best in each game.
        li
          strong Chat in English.
        li
          strong No use of bots or AI.
          p You should play the game and write your messages yourself.
        li
          strong Avoid leaving games before they are done.
          p Leaving a game early hurts the experience for all other players. We reserve the right to deduct points from or ban players that repeatedly leave games before they are finished.
      .ui.text.container
        p.failure-message Failure to comply with these rules may result in your immediate 
          strong disqualification 
          | from the competition.